# BenchmarkDotNet writes a lot per run: raw measurement CSVs, per-benchmark build
# directories, and several report formats. Only the GitHub-flavoured markdown
# reports are worth keeping in history — they carry the full environment block
# (OS, CPU, SDK, runtime, JIT, job config) alongside the numbers, which is what
# makes a quoted figure checkable later.
*
!.gitignore
!**/
!**/*-report-github.md
